# Check out every text file with LF, including on Windows (core.autocrlf=true would give CRLF).
# Generated files such as lib/blog/posts.generated.ts are compared byte for byte in tests.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
